   "splitsInto": [
    "fish-knowledge",
    "fish-behavior"
   ],
   "rule": "Frozen: keeps its current deployed meaning and production data until an approved migration (BA-MIG). It is never reassigned to a single target Brain and never reused for a new meaning after retirement.",
